# Everything the workflow writes is ignored, with one exception: the prepared real and mock datasets are
# kept in the repo. They are small (tens of MB) and expensive to rebuild -- MBQC alone is a 13 GB download
# and eleven hours of DADA2 -- so the repo stays self-contained instead of depending on one directory on
# the cluster. Simulated datasets stay out: they regenerate from a seed in minutes.
results/*
!results/data/
results/data/*
!results/data/real/
!results/data/mock/
data/templates/
